                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I just can't recommend this game, Even for its price. Hatland Adventures is a runner where you gain hats as 1UPs. The game is enjoyable... Until you get to the second level. It's poorly designed considering the fact that you have something chasing behind you. There are multiple parts where you're forced to stop or you'll either take damage or die. I guess it's not a bad price to try it for yourself but I can't recommend it. I didn't have a lot of fun with it.",
